WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.322 --> 00:00:03.654
(serene music)

00:00:03.654 --> 00:00:07.207
(waves rolling gently)

00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:08.971
- Now, I live in paradise here.

00:00:08.971 --> 00:00:11.851
Don't tell too many people about it.

00:00:11.851 --> 00:00:14.927
Show me somewhere better,
it's not possible.

00:00:14.927 --> 00:00:15.760
Nothing.

00:00:17.512 --> 00:00:20.262
(waves rumbling)

00:00:25.012 --> 00:00:27.381
I kitesurf, which I like

00:00:27.381 --> 00:00:28.585
and I've been doing kitesurfing now

00:00:28.585 --> 00:00:30.431
for about seven or eight years.

00:00:30.431 --> 00:00:32.427
Before that I, and I still do,

00:00:32.427 --> 00:00:35.010
windsurf for the last 40 years.

00:00:36.585 --> 00:00:37.440
And it's lovely.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:40.023
You set a course and it's like,

00:00:41.272 --> 00:00:43.605
just like flying on a cloud.

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:48.113
(serene music)

00:00:50.371 --> 00:00:53.886
If heaven's like this
I'll be very happy to go.

00:00:53.886 --> 00:00:55.038
(water splashing)

00:00:55.038 --> 00:00:57.238
You're out there and you're just oblivious

00:00:57.238 --> 00:00:59.159
to the problems in life,

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:01.387
and you go as far or

00:01:01.387 --> 00:01:02.936
as little distance as you like.

00:01:02.936 --> 00:01:03.961
It's just beautiful.

00:01:03.961 --> 00:01:05.190
It's a different world,

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:07.095
and any little problems, any hiccups,

00:01:07.095 --> 00:01:08.414
they just bypass you.

00:01:08.414 --> 00:01:09.888
It's just lovely, you know?

00:01:09.888 --> 00:01:12.338
It's poetry in motion
when you're out there.

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:14.300
And when I die, and I'm gettin' near

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:15.774
the end of my life, I'm hoping

00:01:15.774 --> 00:01:18.282
that there's kites up there.

00:01:18.282 --> 00:01:22.449
(serene music)
(waves rumbling)

00:01:26.397 --> 00:01:30.564
Suddenly my wife died 16 1/2 years ago,

00:01:31.715 --> 00:01:33.607
and very quick, only in two days,

00:01:33.607 --> 00:01:34.908
of breast cancer.

00:01:34.908 --> 00:01:37.369
And she had one chemo and on the Saturday

00:01:37.369 --> 00:01:38.797
at lunch time we were going to go out

00:01:38.797 --> 00:01:40.190
and she wasn't very well,

00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:42.106
and within two days she died.

00:01:42.106 --> 00:01:45.391
And when I saw that I thought,

00:01:45.391 --> 00:01:47.760
I will change my life.

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:50.001
And I started living life all the time.

00:01:50.001 --> 00:01:51.916
I spent the first three or four years

00:01:51.916 --> 00:01:53.391
away nine months a year.

00:01:53.391 --> 00:01:57.174
I was windsurfing, kiting,
skiing, snowboarding.

00:01:57.174 --> 00:01:59.056
I went all around the
world doing these things.

00:01:59.056 --> 00:02:01.587
And then after about three or four years,

00:02:01.587 --> 00:02:03.909
the pain is going so you come back

00:02:03.909 --> 00:02:07.576
and join what one would
term a natural life.

00:02:09.482 --> 00:02:13.379
After I’d seen how my wife left this world

00:02:13.379 --> 00:02:15.411
I changed my way of thinking.

00:02:15.411 --> 00:02:16.688
It could be tomorrow I'll be gone

00:02:16.688 --> 00:02:19.579
so I live each day to the full.

00:02:19.579 --> 00:02:21.262
You'll never know when you're gonna go.

00:02:21.262 --> 00:02:24.327
Although I think I'm healthy,
I could be dead tomorrow.

00:02:24.327 --> 00:02:27.276
Hence why I do all the things I do.

00:02:27.276 --> 00:02:29.943
(wind rumbling)

00:02:32.222 --> 00:02:34.972
(water splashes)

00:02:37.296 --> 00:02:40.544
I was in the Italian Lakes
about three or four years ago

00:02:40.544 --> 00:02:43.353
and there was no wind, and I saw,

00:02:43.353 --> 00:02:47.103
to my belief, a man on
a windsurfer sculling.

00:02:48.682 --> 00:02:49.994
And I thought, what a marvelous idea.

00:02:49.994 --> 00:02:52.444
There's no wind so you can
still get out and do something,

00:02:52.444 --> 00:02:54.116
and hopefully this is the first time

00:02:54.116 --> 00:02:56.633
I've tried it and it may work.

00:02:56.633 --> 00:02:59.064
I'm looking forward to it 'cause today

00:02:59.064 --> 00:03:00.854
there's no wind and it's ideal

00:03:00.854 --> 00:03:03.153
for what I want to do.

00:03:03.153 --> 00:03:07.971
And I can go out on the water
where I love and away I go.

00:03:07.971 --> 00:03:10.804
Being my age, I'm not
bothered what people think.

00:03:10.804 --> 00:03:12.383
I just do what I want to do,

00:03:12.383 --> 00:03:14.588
and I know very well if they had the guts

00:03:14.588 --> 00:03:17.015
or the ingenuity they would also

00:03:17.015 --> 00:03:18.559
like to be with me.

00:03:18.559 --> 00:03:22.460
But sadly, a lot of
people won't do what I do.

00:03:22.460 --> 00:03:25.827
God knows why, but there you are.

00:03:25.827 --> 00:03:28.456
I was on the water a few months ago and

00:03:28.456 --> 00:03:30.093
I didn't want to stop at all then,

00:03:30.093 --> 00:03:31.370
and I thought, I just love it.

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:34.079
I thought then, I'm gonna
live another 10 years.

00:03:34.079 --> 00:03:36.072
And when I tell my friends
they don't like that,

00:03:36.072 --> 00:03:39.468
they think, can't you
go before then, Dave?

00:03:39.468 --> 00:03:42.092
This last, I suppose, 10, 15 years

00:03:42.092 --> 00:03:43.648
I've slowed down.

00:03:43.648 --> 00:03:45.029
I don't run like I used to.

00:03:45.029 --> 00:03:46.585
I can't jump about.

00:03:46.585 --> 00:03:48.884
I haven't changed my ideas, my principles

00:03:48.884 --> 00:03:51.056
in how I think about life.

00:03:51.056 --> 00:03:52.902
Learned a few lessons over the way.

00:03:52.902 --> 00:03:56.235
But I'm still basically the same person.

00:03:57.999 --> 00:04:01.436
I'm an old man but with young thoughts.

00:04:01.436 --> 00:04:03.305
And that not gonna change,

00:04:03.305 --> 00:04:06.126
and the day it does change I will die.

00:04:06.126 --> 00:04:08.793
(upbeat music)

